The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-389048a961993c9e595eb13f5805a46495ee07ab "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-ebb0bb9bb10ca9e2d1e893251f8e55fedf0e95e6 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].